### Origination service token (client credentials): reservations:write programs:read:all
POST {{tokenUrl}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=origination&client_secret={{originationSecret}}

> {% client.global.set("origination", response.body.access_token); %}

### Bank operator: programs:read:all breaks:read
POST {{tokenUrl}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=capacity-local&username=operator&password=operator

> {% client.global.set("operator", response.body.access_token); %}

